Rules useless in grammar

   10 value: item


State 8 conflicts: 1 shift/reduce


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: %empty
    2        | program ifthen EOL

    3 item: NUMBER
    4     | OPEN ifthen CLOSED

    5 rvalue: item

    6 product: rvalue
    7        | product TIMES ifthen

    8 ifthen: product
    9       | IF ifthen THEN ifthen


